1
00:00:00,958 --> 00:00:04,298
(Leonard:)Excuse me
while I go tell Missy the good news.

2
00:00:10,843 --> 00:00:12,303
(Leonard:)- Hey.
- Hi, Penny, how's it going?

3
00:00:12,470 --> 00:00:15,180
(Leonard:)That guy Mike that you were dating,
is that still going on?

4
00:00:15,347 --> 00:00:17,017
(Penny:)- Pretty much, why?
- Just catching up.

5
00:00:17,183 --> 00:00:19,563
(Sheldon:)By the way,
may I speak to Missy, please?

6
00:00:20,811 --> 00:00:22,901
(Sheldon:)Of course.

7
00:00:23,939 --> 00:00:25,149
(Missy:)Hi, Leonard, what's up?

8
00:00:25,316 --> 00:00:29,406
Well, since you're leaving, I was wondering
if you'd like to go to dinner with me.

9
00:00:29,570 --> 00:00:31,650
(Missy:)That's so sweet. But no, thanks.

10
00:00:33,491 --> 00:00:34,781
(Howard:)Oh.

11
00:00:34,950 --> 00:00:37,490
- Do you have other plans or...?
- No.

12
00:00:41,082 --> 00:00:42,542
All right.

13
00:00:43,918 --> 00:00:48,008
(Leonard:)- Enjoy the rest of your evening.
- Thanks, I'll see you.

14
00:00:53,719 --> 00:01:03,019
(Leonard(returning):)Um, here's something
we didn't anticipate.

